WEBVTT

00:02:25.876 --> 00:02:30.196
on national security,
coordination, on NATO.

00:02:30.836 --> 00:02:33.396
And the speech that was given
by Olaf Scholz,

00:02:33.436 --> 00:02:35.516
the new chancellor, two weeks ago,

00:02:35.556 --> 00:02:40.836
in my view, the most significant speech
given by a European leader

00:02:40.876 --> 00:02:43.276
in the post-Cold War environment,

00:02:43.316 --> 00:02:48.316
precisely because it's now
the post-post-Cold War environment,

00:02:48.356 --> 00:02:52.276
sending weapons to the Ukrainians,

00:02:52.316 --> 00:02:57.636
committing to over two percent
of GDP spend on defense,

00:02:57.676 --> 00:03:01.436
investing in a new fund
for defense infrastructure.